# Unity LFS attribute lines: binary extensions and LightingData.asset tracked through Git LFS.
# Adapt into: .gitattributes (after the UnityYAMLMerge block; the later line wins).
# Keep in step with $BinaryExt in .claude/hooks/pre-commit.ps1.
